                <pb facs="0848" n="754" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg754"/>

                <p>Number.</p>
                <p>Personal pass, fiscal year 1886–87. Province of Habana. Transient foreigners,
                    gratis.</p>
                <p>Mrs. Matilde Echarte de Sanguily, native of Cuba, American citizen, province of
                    id., 27 years of age, married, profession, her house in which she resides, and
                    resides there habitually, accompanied by her son Julio, a minor.</p>
                <p>Habana, November 5, 1886.</p>
                <p>By the Governor:</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >E. Guillerme.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
